model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Provider credit facts use an optional bounded observation in retained protocol 41 and live protocol 42. Framework .16 keeps the p42 credential-host adapter while composing the usage-credit contract; protocols through 40 retain their original observation codecs. Routing is pool-scoped, readable only after app access and account inspection; only the pool owner writes policy, and writes acknowledge exact Home readback. Prior protocol observation and check codecs remain frozen. Credits retain vendor units and never share the banked-reset balance."
    }
  }
}
